---
description: >-
  Tests icon resolution priority via config maps: an explicit filenameIcons
  override for README.md, extensionIcons mappings for .ts/.py/.xyz (with .py
  deliberately mapped to "none" to suppress its icon), and an unmapped .bin
  extension falling back to the configured default icon pack
  (material-icon-theme).
config:
  treeView:
    showIcons: true
    defaultIconPack: material-icon-theme
    filenameIcons:
      README.md: 'fa:bell'
    extensionIcons:
      .ts: typescript
      .py: none
      .xyz: javascript
---
treeView-beta
  src/
      main.py
      data.xyz
      index.ts
      unmapped.bin
  README.md
